  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a la Gestin Subnacional en Chile (CCLIP)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Subnational Governance in Chile (CCLIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de esta operacin es profundizar la descentralizacin entregando mayores atribuciones y competencias en los niveles subnacionales, tanto a nivel regional como municipal.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the operation is to deepen the decentralization process, thereby giving more atributions and competencies to the subnational level, both at the regional and the municipal levels.</narrative>
  </description>
